  "operative_text": "Section 1 (Section 23-31-220): \"(2) the right of a private property owner or person in legal possession or control to allow or prohibit the carrying of a concealable weapon upon his premises. However, this provision does not preclude a licensed real estate agent, a prospective property purchaser, or both, who hold a concealed weapon permit from carrying a concealable weapon onto a property listed for sale and being shown to a prospective property purchaser by the real estate agent.\""
